omprising automatic meter reading and advanced metering infrastructure systems. It sells its products under the Canada Valve, Centurion, Echologics, Echoshore, ePulse, Ez-Max, Hersey, Hydro Gate, Hydro-Guard, HYMAX, HYMAX VERSA, Jones, Krausz, LeakFinderRT, Milliken, Mueller, Mueller Systems, Pratt, Pratt Industrial, Repaflex, Repamax, Sentryx, Singer, and U.S. Pipe Valve and Hydrant brands. Its products are used by municipalities, and residential and non-residential construction industries. Mueller Water Products, Inc. was founded in 1857 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.","employees":3300,"website":"https://www.muellerwaterproducts.com","country":"United States","city":"Atlanta","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Paul  McAndrew","title":"President, CEO & Director"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":16.73,"tpe":23.71,"ps":1.96,"pfcf":25.32,"peg":1.445,"pb":3.239,"ev_ebitda":13.79,"rev_growth":0.124,"eps_growth":0.191,"eps_growth_fwd":0.1618,"eps_growth_next":0.1441,"div_yield":0.0076,"roe":0.1468,"roa":0.05862,"de":68.32,"gross_margin":0.3238,"op_margin":0.1206,"profit_margin":0.07536,"current_ratio":1.724},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":14.25,"sector":16.73,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":16.84,"sector":23.71,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":2.492,"sector":1.96,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":25.05,"sector":25.32,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":0.64,"sector":1.445,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":3.189,"sector":3.239,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":42.08,"sector":68.32,"verdict":"Low debt"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Revenue growth","v":-0.011,"sector":0.124,"verdict":"Weak"},{"k":"eps_growth","label":"EPS growth (last qtr, y/y)","v":-0.018,"sector":0.191,"verdict":"Weak"},{"k":"eps_growth_fwd","label":"EPS growth (this year, est.)","v":0.0047,"sector":0.1618,"verdict":"Weak"},{"k